WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.833
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:05.708
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:07.416
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.750
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.583
This is

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:11.541
The Champions

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:13.041
Man U?

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:15.500
More like Man Me

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.166
I don’t dress to impress

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:18.791
I dress to gegenpress

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:21.791
Can you tell us some more about yourself Kevin?

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.250
De Bruyne

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:29.041
Remember that amazing goal I scored to win the Puskas?

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:30.791
Neither do I

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:37.750
He’s coming! He’s coming!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.708
You guys, you guys, get into position

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.875
I’m the most decorated. Respect!

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.166
Our great maestro arrives!

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:44.875
How are you?

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:45.458
Terrible

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:48.083
I could use a massage. My center back is killing me.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.375
Hello, Red Devils

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:50.541
I apologize for being late

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:51.625
I lost the dressing room

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.500
I mean, I lost my way to the dressing room

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:56.666
It’s the media. The media want to say things are bad here.

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.916
They say my players are sad

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:59.208
They are wrong

00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:02.583
And so to prove this I am forcing all the players to come to my party tonight

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:12.541
I’ve gathered you all here to remind you

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.250
that just because you are not good

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.250
doesn't mean we can't have a good time

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.875
Now enjoy your mandatory meal

00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:19.416
What’s the matter, Luke?

00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:20.958
Not enough cholesterol in this for you?

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:21.583
What is this?

00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:22.375
This looks like crap

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:23.083
Excusez-moi

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.625
could I have a bigger roll?

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:25.750
I don't get Harry Maguire

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.791
you don't get more food

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:27.958
All right, let’s party!

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:29.500
Alexis, play...

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:32.791
Coach, I don’t really want to do this

00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:40.708
Never list additional skills on your CV

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:41.916
Hello

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:43.625
Oh hey, David Moyes is here!

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:44.250
Goodbye

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.625
Aw, and he’s gone

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.500
Oh man, this is more boring than hearing Harry Kane

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.125
tell us about how much he misses his wife

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.458
OK, who wants to play a game?

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:52.500
You guys want to play a game?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.916
So the object of this game is uh

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.416
you try to score once

00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:01.250
and then after that you sit back and wait for time to run out

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.458
It’s the best way to waste 90 minutes!

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:05.791
Oh...a special ONE.

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:07.666
That means I get to throw a player under the bus

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.250
Let’s see…

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.125
Ah, so many choices! Oh, God....

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:13.000
How about...

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.250
I don’t want to play this anymore

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.875
Oh you will play where I say you play

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:18.333
Paul

00:02:18.375 --> 00:02:19.166
Paul, I am kidding.

00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:21.250
I only say this because you are my favorite

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.291
This game is not fun

00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:24.958
Games are not supposed to be fun

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:26.666
They’re supposed to be hard and tedious

00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:28.500
What is this?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:29.750
What is this garbage?!

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:31.333
Paul!

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:32.250
Ooh, you traitor!

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.208
Can we go, coach?

00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:33.791
Yeah, no problem

00:02:33.791 --> 00:02:35.000
You’re loaned to Millwall

00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:37.375
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:40.791
Someone told me that this party needed new energy

00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:41.833
You were not invited

00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:42.625
Go away

